      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Up to 3 friends can face relentless swarms of Tems together. Don't have friends to play with? No worries, use the matchmaking system to find other Swarmers! Strategize, share resources(or don’t!), and take down increasingly more powerful bosses. Maximize your attack potential by coordinating gears and skills with precision timing, creating overpowered synergies.",
